Pharmacy Management System 

Version 1.0 
Specification : 
User Authentication – Secure login for admin and pharmacist.
Medicine Management – Add, update, delete, and search medicines.
Inventory Management – Track medicine stock and availability.
Supplier Management – Store and manage supplier information.
Customer Management – Maintain customer/patient details.
Prescription Management – Record and manage prescriptions.
Billing System – Generate bills and invoices automatically.
Expiry Management – Track expired and near-expiry medicines.
Sales Management – Maintain daily and monthly sales records.
Report Generation – Generate sales, stock, purchase, and expiry reports.
  
